id: pm-github-samq
title: Coordinate caller adoption and source-content remediation for scheduled workflows
description: "After pm-github-3it2 is released, update affected reusable workflow SHA pins through caller-owned review. All 21 named caller repositories are listed in docs/scheduled-workflow-refusals.md. Align newline required-checks declarations where GITHUB_TOKEN cannot read administration-only protection. pm-changelog sync job 121514139043 also requires source-content remediation or a reviewed narrow allowlist for absolute-host-path body findings; package diagnostics must preserve that refusal. No caller mutation belongs to the package fix."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[5]: caller-adoption,closeout,follow-up,"gh:unbraind/pm-github#175",sync
